      "source": [
        "## Understand the problem and define objectives\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Clearly define the real-world problem you want to address using AI and set specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound (SMART) objectives for your AI solution.\n"
      ]
    },
